Apollo 16 Soil Mechanics                                                      
Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) Page B-1                             
                                                                              
Calibrations for Apollo 16 Data Reduction                                     
                                                                              
Handwritten Notes on the pre- and post-flight calibrations to be used         
for the ratio of actual to recorded drum reading for penetration (31.3)       
and the load calibration to take into account the weight of the               
penetrometer (3.49 N).                                                        
